  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd \"Open example\" to the File ribbon's Open list.\nList direct `.camproj` files from `examples/` beside the executable in name order.\nHide the entry when that directory is absent or the app runs in a browser.\nUse the existing project-open command and its unsaved-changes prompt.\nShow \"No example projects\" for an empty directory.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe release package includes example projects, but the File ribbon cannot list them.\nAn empty recent-project list opens the file dialog directly.\n\n## Before and after screenshots\n\nThese images show the File Open menu from the actual shell renderer.\nThe capture uses the same recent project in both views.\n\nBefore: the original menu at upstream/main `31f8d03d744e77ce707282d816e11efe0922f239`.\n\n![Original File Open menu](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/2059/before.png)\n\nAfter: the menu at PR head `8c48203a3d5441d49df84f36235bc983e9540771`, with the example submenu open.\n\n![File Open menu with the example submenu](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/2059/after.png)\n\nThe images are stored only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch.\nThe capture used an egui test harness. It did not use a native window or an installed release package.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe first pin failed on unchanged production code.\nThe UI pins cover these cases:\n\n- `open_example_entry_is_available_without_recent_projects`\n- `open_example_lists_only_direct_projects_in_name_order`\n- `open_example_selection_keeps_the_unsaved_project_guard`\n- `open_example_is_hidden_without_the_installed_directory`\n- `open_example_is_hidden_in_browser_and_model_menus`\n- `open_example_empty_directory_has_a_clear_message`\n\nEach mutation failed its pin. Each restored implementation passed all six pins.\nMutations covered the upstream implementation, browser exclusion, project-only menu, and directory check.\nThey also covered the extension filter, regular-file filter, name order, and guarded open command.\nThe existing recent-file menu tests also passed.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed.\nThe gate ran the UI library and 17 integration suites.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nTest fixtures use separate directories for each test thread.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNative window interaction, browser compilation, and an installed release package.\nFilesystem permission errors and failure to locate the executable.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nChangelog: Add Open example to the File Open list for packaged example projects.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #2043\n",
